      "id": "gcp-paas-001",
      "title": "Public network access disabled by default",
      "description": "Cloud Run, Cloud Functions, and App Engine must document public ingress disabled or restricted with IAM, VPC connector, or internal load balancers only.",
      "severity": "Critical",
      "priority": "P0",
      "remediationGuidance": "Tag public-access posture on services[].Tags; verify ingress settings and allUsers/allAuthenticatedUsers bindings in gcpExtractor.",
